The PlAI Testr guide for AI assistants is `.plai_testr/gem/docs/AGENTS.md`: read it before working here. `.plai_testr/gem` links to the installed gem (every `plai_testr` command and spec run keeps it current), so its `README.md`, `docs/` and `templates/examples/` are there too. Gem-wide guidance lives in the gem; this file holds only what is specific to this app.

